# ============================================================
# /media/ — gitignore the binary asset slot, KEEP the READMEs.
#
# The /media/ folder structure + per-folder READMEs ARE committed.
# The actual binary assets (icons, screenshots, fonts, recordings)
# are NOT — designers collaborate via Figma / Drive / S3, not git.
#
# Pattern:
#   - Ignore every file under /media/...
#   - Un-ignore README.md at every depth (the docs are the spec)
#   - Un-ignore .gitkeep at every depth (so empty folders survive)
# ============================================================
/media/**/*
!/media/**/
!/media/**/README.md
!/media/**/.gitkeep
